 <h3><u>Ye hussaini kaafla</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Ye hussaini kaafla</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>(Chehlum karke hussain ka) x2</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Maqtal se chala kaafila </p> <p>Zainab ne di sadaa</p> <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun</p> <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Haay - Majlise chehlume shabbir sare dashte bala</li>
    <p>Kar chuke ehle haram girya o maatam barpa</p>
    <p>(Kaasimo akbaro abbas ka pursa bhi diya) x2</p>
    <p>Ye to sab hogaya ek kaam bacha he tera </p>
    <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p>
    <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p>
    <li>Haay - Jaanti hun ke ghamo ranj se lachar he tu </li>
    <p>Yaad mein baali sakina ki giriftaar he tu</p>
    <p>(Meri tarha se bahattar ka azadar he tu) x2</p>
    <p>Kaarwaane shahe mazloom ka salaar he tu </p>
    <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p>
    <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p>
    <li>Haay - Yun to ye kaam bhi karsakti hun mein tashna jigar </li>
    <p>Qalbe zainab ki yehi aakhri khwahish he magar</p>
    <p>(Ek imam aaya tha hum sab ko watan se lekar) x2</p>
    <p>Ek imam apne dilafghaaron ko lejaaye ghar</p>
    <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p>
    <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p>
    <li>Haay - Apne nana ko ye rudad sunane ke liye</li>
    <p>Zakhm pardes mein jo paaye dikhaane ke liye</p>
    <p>(Dadi zehra ko har ek baat bataane ke liye) x2</p>
    <p>Fatima Sughra ko seene se lagaane ke liye </p>
    <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p>
    <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p>
    <li>Haay - Wada Shabbir ka he beta agar yaad tujhe</li>
    <p>Dil se ay beta bhulaani he har uftaad tujhe </p>
    <p>(Laaj rakhni he meri sayyade sajjad tujhe) x2</p>
    <p>Phir se nana ka shehr karna he abaad tujhe </p>
    <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p>
    <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p>
    <li>Haay - Naqsh is dil pe mere laal musibat he teri</li>
    <p>Ruh ke zakhmon men pewast azziat he teri</p>
    <p>(Jo hua so woh huwa beta ye kismet he teri) x2</p>
    <p>Ab bhi nana ke madeene ko zaroorat he teri </p>
    <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p>
    <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p>
    <li>Haay - Dekh ay laal ye tujhko bhi he mujh ko bhi yaqeen</li>
    <p>Khoon royegi mere haal pe yathrib ki zameen</p>
    <p>(Fatima Sughra ka mein saamna karsakti nahin) x2</p>
    <p>Isliye kehti hun tujhse ay mere maah jabeen</p>
    <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p>
    <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p>
    <li>Haay - Haaye kya mazharo irfan qayamat thi bapa</li>
   </ol> <p>Peet kar seena o sar karte the saadat buka</p> <p>(Baap ki kabr se woh kaafla salaar utha) x2</p> <p>Thaam kar baazue sajjad jo zainab ne kaha </p> <p>Ay mere sajjad sun kafla salaar sun </p> <p>Ye hussaini kaafla tu watan tak leke jaa</p></font>
